Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.49,0:00:07.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, you guys. Hey, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.49,0:00:07.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗨  你俩在干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.93,0:00:09.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Figuring out our wedding plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.93,0:00:09.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}筹备婚礼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.71,0:00:11.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Funny. We were doing the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.71,0:00:11.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太巧了  我们也正合计这事呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.32,0:00:17.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's really crazy. The hall, the dress, the food.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.32,0:00:17.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}疯了  场地  服装  食品
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.70,0:00:20.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I had no idea how expensive this was.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.70,0:00:20.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没想到结个婚这么贵
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.29,0:00:21.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, it is really pricey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.29,0:00:21.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是很贵
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.55,0:00:23.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I freaked when I heard the numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.55,0:00:23.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}第一次算出结婚费用  我被那个数字吓呆了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.50,0:00:24.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, what did you two do about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.50,0:00:24.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}结果你们怎么做的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.88,0:00:26.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It was simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.88,0:00:26.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}简单
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.31,0:00:28.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I came up with some cost-cutting solutions...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.31,0:00:28.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想出了一些省钱方案
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.44,0:00:31.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...wrote out a list, and Monica told me to go to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.44,0:00:31.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}列了个清单  结果莫妮卡叫我去死
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.51,0:00:33.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's no way around it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.51,0:00:33.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没钱好省的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.98,0:00:36.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just accept that this is gonna cost a lot of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.98,0:00:36.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只能接受现实  确实会花很多钱
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.78,0:00:40.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I heard that weddings are, like, a $40 billion-a-year industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.78,0:00:40.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听说每年花在结婚上的钱高达400亿
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.29,0:00:43.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. And I'm responsible for just, like, half of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.29,0:00:43.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这其中我贡献过半
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.35,0:00:48.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But really, it does seem like this money could be put to better use.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.35,0:00:48.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我觉得这钱应该用在更有意义的事上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.92,0:00:50.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.92,0:00:50.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当真
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.25,0:00:51.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. How would you feel
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.25,0:00:51.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}把婚礼经费
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.97,0:00:53.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}if we gave all the wedding money to charity...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.97,0:00:53.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}捐献给慈善事业
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.72,0:00:56.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and we just got married at City Hall?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.72,0:00:56.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们就到市政厅登个记  如何
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.14,0:00:58.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think it would make me wanna marry you even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.14,0:00:58.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这让我越发想娶你了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.24,0:01:04.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I gotta say, you guys, that's an incredible gesture.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.24,0:01:04.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不得不说  你们的高姿态  很好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.71,0:01:06.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe you do that next time you get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.71,0:01:06.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}下次你结婚也这么干如何
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.08,0:01:12.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no, no. The next time's gonna be Hawaii at sunset.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.08,0:01:12.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不不不  下次我要在夏威夷斜阳下结婚
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.42,0:01:15.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But maybe the time after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.42,0:01:15.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不过下下次可以听取你的意见
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.44,0:01:18.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Friends S10E07 The One With The Home Study
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.44,0:01:18.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《老友记》  第十季  第7集  领养中心来家访
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.19,0:01:58.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Hey. What's going on? - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.19,0:01:58.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-嘿  忙啥呢  -嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.82,0:02:01.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Our adoption social worker is coming,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.82,0:02:01.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}领养中心有人来家访
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.16,0:02:02.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}so we're cleaning the apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.16,0:02:02.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以我们在扫除
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.74,0:02:03.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"We"?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.74,0:02:03.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.03,0:02:06.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know you don't want me to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.03,0:02:06.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不想我掺和
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.01,0:02:08.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You can't have it both ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.01,0:02:08.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别现在又说这个
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.35,0:02:11.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is this the person who decides
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.35,0:02:11.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这个人能决定
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.77,0:02:13.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}whether or not you get a baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.77,0:02:13.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们是否收养一个孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.16,0:02:15.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Kind of. She's coming by to interview us and see where we live.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.16,0:02:15.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}差不多  这人来视察我们的生活环境
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.85,0:02:17.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And it has to go perfectly,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.85,0:02:17.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们必须表现得完美
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.22,0:02:18.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}because if she doesn't like something about us
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.22,0:02:18.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}若她对我们有丝毫不满
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.83,0:02:19.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}she can keep us off
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.83,0:02:19.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她就会让我们进不了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.86,0:02:21.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}every adoption list in the state.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.86,0:02:21.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}全国任何一个领养的名单里
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.28,0:02:22.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, maybe I should stop by.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.28,0:02:22.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我可以过来友情协力一把
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.72,0:02:24.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She could be a soap opera fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.72,0:02:24.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她没准爱看肥皂剧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.99,0:02:26.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's very impressive
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.99,0:02:26.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}小人物认识演艺名流
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.07,0:02:27.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}when the little people know a celebrity.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.07,0:02:27.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可以蓬壁生辉呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.36,0:02:30.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Little people"?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.36,0:02:30.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}小人物
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.96,0:02:32.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Celebrity."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.96,0:02:32.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}名流
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.81,0:02:35.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So I think I'm just about done here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.81,0:02:35.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我觉得我做的差不多了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.39,0:02:38.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Unless you have any bad stuff hidden somewhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.39,0:02:38.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}除非你还在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.45,0:02:40.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}like porn or cigarettes?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.45,0:02:40.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}藏了像黄书  香烟什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.91,0:02:41.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.91,0:02:41.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.58,0:02:45.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- No. - Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.58,0:02:45.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-才没有  -钱德勒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.93,0:02:49.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.93,0:02:49.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没有
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.95,0:02:52.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and I'm offended by the insinuation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.95,0:02:52.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这样玷污人家清白太气人了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.05,0:02:55.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So there's not a magazine under the couch...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.05,0:02:55.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}沙发下没有杂志
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.65,0:02:58.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...or cigarettes taped to the back of the toilet tank...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.65,0:02:58.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}厕所水箱后没有一包香烟
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.90,0:03:01.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...or a filthy video in the VCR?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.90,0:03:01.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}录象机里没有A片
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.51,0:03:04.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll admit to the cigarettes and magazine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.51,0:03:04.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}香烟和杂志我认帐
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.30,0:03:05.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But that tape is not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.30,0:03:05.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但带子不是我的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.37,0:03:07.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It isn't mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.37,0:03:07.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也不是我的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.67,0:03:09.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I guess we'll never know whose it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.67,0:03:09.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想我们永远不会知道是谁的了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.14,0:03:19.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}May I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.14,0:03:19.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可以帮忙吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.07,0:03:20.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes. We're here
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.07,0:03:20.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们来给孩子们
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.30,0:03:22.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}to make a rather sizable donation to the children.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.30,0:03:22.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}捐一大笔钱
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.98,0:03:24.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Any contribution, large or small,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.98,0:03:24.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}捐钱不论多少  心意都是一样重
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.69,0:03:25.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}is appreciated.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.69,0:03:25.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们都会感激
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.69,0:03:27.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think you're gonna appreciate
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.69,0:03:27.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}数目这样大
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.08,0:03:28.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}the crap out of this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.08,0:03:28.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你一定会把屎都感动出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.42,0:03:30.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, this is very generous.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.42,0:03:30.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们真大方
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.00,0:03:32.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And we don't want any recognition.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.00,0:03:32.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们要匿名捐助
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.68,0:03:34.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is completely anonymous.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.68,0:03:34.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}完全匿名
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.57,0:03:37.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Completely anonymous. From two kind strangers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.57,0:03:37.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}完全匿名  就写两个陌生人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.24,0:03:39.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mr. X and Phoebe Buffay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.24,0:03:39.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}先生甲和菲比·布菲
