Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.27,0:03:43.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们可以把二位的名字登到新闻通讯里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.69,0:03:44.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.69,0:03:44.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没必要
