Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.55,0:03:46.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}布菲的拼法是  B-U-F-F-A-Y
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.85,0:03:51.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And X is spelled "Mike Hannigan."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.85,0:03:51.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}先生甲的写法是  迈克·汉尼根
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.56,0:03:55.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, on behalf of the children, thank you both very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.56,0:03:55.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我代表孩子们多谢两位
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.57,0:03:58.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm glad we did this. It feels so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.57,0:03:58.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我很高兴我们这么做了  感觉真棒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.19,0:03:59.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It does. It feels really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.19,0:03:59.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是啊  非常棒
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.51,0:04:02.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, look. And we get these free T-shirts.
